(5600879, 812046, 15511, '<td valign="top">There''s a lot of green light entering your lens, so much that the subject has a green cast. The quickest fix could be to use the "auto" setting in the PS curves dialog. Set the option to "enhance per channel contrast" as the default. You could do this and sharpen in just a couple of minutes, and you''d still have time to upload your entry.</td>', 'There''s a lot of green light entering your lens, so much that the subject has a green cast. The quickest fix could be to use the "auto" setting in the PS curves dialog. Set the option to "enhance per channel contrast" as the default. You could do this and sharpen in just a couple of minutes, and you''d still have time to upload your entry.', '2009-08-06 01:35:04.000000', NULL, 1),
