(5602883, 812027, 29490, '<td valign="top">That appears to be a Penrod I see in that tube.  I always get big static zaps when I go in those tubes, especially the slides - I could probably light a 30 watt bulb for 10 seconds after I''m done sliding.  But enough of my ramblings:<br/> <br/>Nicely composed and well executed!  I really like the idea and you''ve done well with it.  To pick nits I would almost say a snooted light +1/3ev on her face/eyes to make it pop a little, but I would have to see the final result because it may just make her fade into the greys of the tube, tonally speaking.  My nit aside I say this deserves a place on your wall :)<br/> <br/>Next time you use the tube it might be interesting if you brought some chickens and have them looking in all the holes on the sides.  Although chickens can sometimes be unruly ... and they are the dickens to direct.</td>', 'That appears to be a Penrod I see in that tube.  I always get big static zaps when I go in those tubes, especially the slides - I could probably light a 30 watt bulb for 10 seconds after I''m done sliding.  But enough of my ramblings: Nicely composed and well executed!  I really like the idea and you''ve done well with it.  To pick nits I would almost say a snooted light +1/3ev on her face/eyes to make it pop a little, but I would have to see the final result because it may just make her fade into the greys of the tube, tonally speaking.  My nit aside I say this deserves a place on your wall :) Next time you use the tube it might be interesting if you brought some chickens and have them looking in all the holes on the sides.  Although chickens can sometimes be unruly ... and they are the dickens to direct.', '2009-08-07 17:02:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602888, 812036, 29490, '<td valign="top">Focus seems a bit off and I would prefer if the hand shadow was crisp. I feel (and this is subjective) if the game were on a white seamless it might have more impact, compositionally speaking. <br/> <br/>Overall a very good idea for a photo and meets the challenge with a plethora of circles.  <br/> <br/>I like the term ''hand shadow'', as in "I''m being followed by a hand shadow, hand shadow".</td>', 'Focus seems a bit off and I would prefer if the hand shadow was crisp. I feel (and this is subjective) if the game were on a white seamless it might have more impact, compositionally speaking.  Overall a very good idea for a photo and meets the challenge with a plethora of circles.   I like the term ''hand shadow'', as in "I''m being followed by a hand shadow, hand shadow".', '2009-08-07 17:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602889, 811898, 29490, '<td valign="top">And a good morning to you --- mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm. Nicely composed and executed.  Side seems a little hot but that''s me nit picking.  Overall this is a dandy photo.</td>', 'And a good morning to you --- mmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmmm. Nicely composed and executed.  Side seems a little hot but that''s me nit picking.  Overall this is a dandy photo.', '2009-08-07 17:13:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(5602896, 811872, 98339, '<td valign="top">personally if the had been a night it would have "stood out" more...because of the trees moving during the daylight hours you get a blur from the long exposure...whereby at night you would have had a silhouette of the trees and the blur wouldn''t have stood out so much</td>', 'personally if the had been a night it would have "stood out" more...because of the trees moving during the daylight hours you get a blur from the long exposure...whereby at night you would have had a silhouette of the trees and the blur wouldn''t have stood out so much', '2009-08-07 17:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
