(5604088, 810429, 73541, '<td valign="top">I agree on consistency with the topic on second sight. I rate that photo 5 because challenge titles should catch my eye right away. I''m sorry but -on the oter hand- don''t feel bad for you since this picture doesn''t left a doubt you''re a talented photographer and you can take a few bad votings. keep it up!</td>', 'I agree on consistency with the topic on second sight. I rate that photo 5 because challenge titles should catch my eye right away. I''m sorry but -on the oter hand- don''t feel bad for you since this picture doesn''t left a doubt you''re a talented photographer and you can take a few bad votings. keep it up!', '2009-08-08 13:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
