(5608341, 811141, 108351, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I knew that I could have done better going in. This was basically a snap shot, and suffered from camera shake. I liked the picture I took from the <a href="//www.flickr.com/photos/chadhinkle/3773099331/" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">top of the stairs</a> better. This was taken the morning the challenge was announced, and I didn''t have a chance to go back and do it justice.<br/>My haste to finally enter a contest outweighed my dissatisfaction with the focus. Thanks DPC for making my first contest fun.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I knew that I could have done better going in. This was basically a snap shot, and suffered from camera shake. I liked the picture I took from the top of the stairs better. This was taken the morning the challenge was announced, and I didn''t have a chance to go back and do it justice.My haste to finally enter a contest outweighed my dissatisfaction with the focus. Thanks DPC for making my first contest fun.', '2009-08-12 01:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(5608342, 812038, 99981, '<td valign="top">Nossa <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=92847" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Lelez</a>!!! Foto muito boa!<br/>Great abstract, congrats for the posthumous blue ribbon! I hope you keep joining more challenges, it''s really nice to have another brazilian in every open challenge!<br/>Parabéns pelo escore também!<br/> <br/>PS: Nesse eu não fui tão bem, hehe, acho que o pessoal achou muito normal e não achou meu objeto muito "circular"!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2009-08-12 00:44:23.</i></td>', 'Nossa  Lelez!!! Foto muito boa!Great abstract, congrats for the posthumous blue ribbon! I hope you keep joining more challenges, it''s really nice to have another brazilian in every open challenge!Parabéns pelo escore também! PS: Nesse eu não fui tão bem, hehe, acho que o pessoal achou muito normal e não achou meu objeto muito "circular"!', '2009-08-12 01:14:25.000000', '2009-08-12 01:44:23.000000', 0),
