(5608831, 811984, 9285, '<td valign="top">Hi Taylor.. As I was saying.. the subject of the shot.. which is the berries.. is not obvious.. a close up would be good... or you could try arranging the berries in a circle. It''s about the theme.. so if the photo doesn''t bring out the theme... it''ll not score..<br/> <br/>Don''t give up.. Good luck for the next challenge.. :)<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Eric.</td>', 'Hi Taylor.. As I was saying.. the subject of the shot.. which is the berries.. is not obvious.. a close up would be good... or you could try arranging the berries in a circle. It''s about the theme.. so if the photo doesn''t bring out the theme... it''ll not score.. Don''t give up.. Good luck for the next challenge.. :) CheersEric.', '2009-08-12 09:15:27.000000', NULL, 0),
