(5609434, 812033, 51747, '<td valign="top">Nice shot Scott. You really have to get lucky to get a nice crisp image of the moon in the summer. Good choice for the challenge!</td>', 'Nice shot Scott. You really have to get lucky to get a nice crisp image of the moon in the summer. Good choice for the challenge!', '2009-08-12 19:35:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609453, 811329, 81530, '<td valign="top">Congrats!</td>', 'Congrats!', '2009-08-12 19:55:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(5609456, 812047, 16912, '<td valign="top">Greetings from Andi via the Critique Club<br/> <br/><b>First Impression:</b> Whilst the border may have tried to replicate colours in the image it fails for me and cheapens the image. Nice colours in the lens.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> Fills the frame nicely with a little background, central would be the way to go with this shot though the angle doesn''t help with the circle theme.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> Yup, the lens is a circle but its not shown as one here and whilst we all know a lens is circular to score well we need to see circles.<br/> <br/><b>Technical:</b> The focus/exposure on the lens name is spot and there are nice colours in the lens with a good dof and exposure<br/> <br/><b>Final thoughts:</b> An ok shot but it doesn''t have any WOW for me and the border is still bothering me.</td>', 'Greetings from Andi via the Critique Club First Impression: Whilst the border may have tried to replicate colours in the image it fails for me and cheapens the image. Nice colours in the lens. Composition: Fills the frame nicely with a little background, central would be the way to go with this shot though the angle doesn''t help with the circle theme. Subject: Yup, the lens is a circle but its not shown as one here and whilst we all know a lens is circular to score well we need to see circles. Technical: The focus/exposure on the lens name is spot and there are nice colours in the lens with a good dof and exposure Final thoughts: An ok shot but it doesn''t have any WOW for me and the border is still bothering me.', '2009-08-12 19:58:27.000000', NULL, 0),
