(5609821, 811066, 50695, '<td valign="top">"I wish it made one whole circle, because thats what the challenge asks for, nice colors, 5"<br/> <br/>"The idea is good.. but the execution can be improved.. Would be good to see a full circle."<br/> <br/>Wow, talk about not being able to draw a line between two points. That''s just sad.<br/> <br/></td>', '"I wish it made one whole circle, because thats what the challenge asks for, nice colors, 5" "The idea is good.. but the execution can be improved.. Would be good to see a full circle." Wow, talk about not being able to draw a line between two points. That''s just sad. ', '2009-08-13 00:21:05.000000', NULL, 0),
