(5609980, 811851, 2780, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ssturges:</b></div><hr/><i> I keep looking to see if you''re in the shot, but I can''t find you. How did you do this? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>If you get in the right position you''re hidden between the panels, as it''s not a perfect spere :)</td>', 'Originally posted by ssturges: I keep looking to see if you''re in the shot, but I can''t find you. How did you do this?   If you get in the right position you''re hidden between the panels, as it''s not a perfect spere :)', '2009-08-13 05:02:32.000000', NULL, 0),
