(5610118, 811329, 82707, '<td valign="top">It is such a thrill to win a ribbon on DPC.  Thank you, so much, to everyone who has left a comment.....I''ve just read my initial response, and whilst it seems lukewarm, I can assure you, it was just shock!!!  I''m totally euphoric!!!  <br/> <br/>...and Roz, you got the title! Thank-you! ...(Skips off...... singing (..loudly and out of tune, of course,) and dancing!!!)</td>', 'It is such a thrill to win a ribbon on DPC.  Thank you, so much, to everyone who has left a comment.....I''ve just read my initial response, and whilst it seems lukewarm, I can assure you, it was just shock!!!  I''m totally euphoric!!!   ...and Roz, you got the title! Thank-you! ...(Skips off...... singing (..loudly and out of tune, of course,) and dancing!!!)', '2009-08-13 09:11:45.000000', NULL, 0),
